  "observed": "The first Codex's native process starts `app-server --listen unix:// --analytics-default-enabled --managed-daemon` as a child in its own session with no controlling terminal, carrying that Terminal's HC_SCOPE. It holds every rollout and thread-writer lock of both Terminals; neither Terminal's own processes hold any. Rollouts have source vscode. Its sibling `app-server daemon pid-update-loop` shares the scope and holds no rollout. Ending the first Terminal ended the daemon, and the second Terminal's Codex showed `Reconnecting to server` while its status stayed live."
